  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">凿切工艺</h1><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BAscRYKm/images/cbbeeca232f2632aef4ac4856f80c2e7566a4461.png\" alt=\"凿切工艺\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/I80VLV.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"Terrarium制作\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fresourceful-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/jUWHY2.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"需要Resourceful Lib\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fathena-ctm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=http://images.teamresourceful.com/u/TNilje.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"需要Athena\"></a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p>你是否曾梦想用砂岩大砖块建造一座史诗般的城堡？或是用纯岩浆块打造下界要塞？又或者你只是想用泥土建个小屋，或用臭名昭著的花岗岩脸谱堆个图腾柱？无论你的想法如何，我们都能满足！</p>\n<p>《凿切工艺》是一款适用于1.16+版本的建筑模组，它极大地扩展了游戏中可用的方块种类。该模组提供了超过11,000种独特的建筑方块，从染色玻璃变体到混凝土、海晶石，甚至镶金黑石！所有纹理不仅采用原版风格手工绘制，还包含大量由<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fathena-ctm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Athena</a>驱动的连接纹理！</p>\n<p>受热门模组Chisel的启发，《凿切工艺》让建造者能够充分发挥创造力——因为每个方块都值得拥有伙伴！</p>\n<p>要开始使用，你只需制作七种工作台中的任意一种，这些工作台能将各种原版方块转化为对应的凿切变体。所有工作台外观不同但功能相同，你可以选择最契合建筑风格的一款，或制作多个不同款式点缀你的家园。无论你想实现什么构想，《凿切工艺》都能助你将其变为现实！</p>\n<br>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/r9FApKUUDnE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h4>程序开发：</h4>\nGrim, Alex Nijjar, MsRandom1, CodexAdrian, ThatGravyBoat\n<h4>美术设计：</h4>\nKekie6, Marc-IceBlade, Shrimp, Facu, Frogipher, SunsetSoup, Valilla, Brother Earth, Joosh, ArtistMonster, Zilver</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/514923/description_c1dc4fb6-bae9-4212-a47f-d7a3a4dea600.jpg\" alt=\"与好友同乐的最佳方式。使用Essential Mod游玩\" width=\"837\" height=\"164\"></a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">✨社交平台✨<br><br></h3>\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutube.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/terrariumearth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitch-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitch\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftwitter.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitter-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkofi.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTerrarium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/terrariumearth/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></div>\n<h3>探索我们的其他项目<br><br></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fhandcrafted\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/9DjUsr.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"手工艺品\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fchipped\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/lRunun.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"凿切工艺\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fad-astra\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/snZW6z.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"直上星河\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252ftempad\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/HPp8Fo.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"时空平板\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fspirit\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/SQ4Me7.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"缤纷杜鹃\" width=\"96\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remo